id: VS-07-risk-monitoring
name: "VS-07 \u2014 Risk Monitoring"
short_description: Keep risk posture current through indicators and breach workflows;
  trigger timely mitigation and escalation.
owner:
- Ops leaders
- Risk Owners
- Risk Function
stakeholders:
- Ops leaders
- Risk Owners
- Risk Function
- ExCo/Board
