- monitoring data feeds
- incident signals
- control health
- supplier performance.
outputs:
- Indicator catalogue
- live dashboards
- breach logs
- mitigation actions
- updated risk posture.
triggers:
- KRI/KCI thresholds
- anomaly detection
- operational events
- emerging risk signals.
